OL,3,AItaly ministers agree to ban burqa and
OL,4,Aniqab in school and cap foreigners in
OL,5,Aclass
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Italian government has approved a
OL,8,Fban on the burqa and niqab in schools,
OL,9,Falong with a limit on the share of
OL,10,Fpupils who speak little Italian in any
OL,11,Fone class.
OL,13,FA 30% cap will be imposed on children
OL,14,Fwithout Italian citizenship or poor
OL,15,Fknowledge of the Italian language in
OL,16,Fthe first year of primary, middle and
OL,17,Fhigh school.
OL,19,FPrime Minister Giorgia Meloni described
OL,20,Fthe measures as "common-sense tools
OL,21,Fthat do not divide but really help to
OL,22,Fintegrate".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
