OL,5,Aclass
OL,6,
OL,7,FOpposition parties accuse the
OL,8,Fgovernment of pandering to the policies
OL,9,Fof the hard-right Futuro Nazionale
OL,10,Fparty, ahead of a general election next
OL,11,Fyear.
